    "Description": "IBM Java SE version 8 includes the IBM Java Runtime Environment and the IBM Java Software Development Kit.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* OpenJDK: Improve Resource Resolving (2026-08 Security Update) (CVE-2026-60589)\n\n* OpenJDK: Enhance HTTP Connections (2026-08 Security Update) (CVE-2026-61308)\n\n* OpenJDK: Enhance TLS server (2026-08 Security Update) (CVE-2026-70907)\n\n* openj9: Eclipse OpenJ9: Denial of Service via crafted .class file (CVE-2026-16440)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
